# --- Build artifacts ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/*.user
**/.vs/
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.dotsettings.user

# --- Generated / cache ---
# 5GB de patches descargados por el launcher: NO subir
data/clientPatch/**/*.patch
*.log
*.tmp

# --- IDE / OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- tools/ exclusions ---
# Solo MeteorReborn.Launcher se sube. El resto son utilities locales o experimentales.
tools/HashTester/
tools/MeteorReborn.PacketProxy/
tools/MeteorReborn.PacketTool/
tools/decode_lpb.py

# --- Launcher settings (vive en %APPDATA%) ---
**/launcher.json

# --- Tracker interno, no se sube ---
PORT_PROGRESS.md
